.TH DANBY-SWINGINGCENSER 1
.SH NAME
danby-swingingcenser \- simulate a censer driven by hand motion
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swingingcenser
.SH DESCRIPTION
The suspension point is accelerated horizontally by a prescribed rhythm.  Its
acceleration appears as a tangential inertial force on the censer, allowing
resonant growth or suppression according to phase.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps while paused,
R resets, and Q exits.
